[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10380.309, "timestamp": "02:53:00", "text": "它不是。那不是涅槃。对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10382.15, "timestamp": "02:53:02", "text": "就像你把腺体搞混了一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10391.59, "timestamp": "02:53:11", "text": "我的天哪。通常我们就这么称呼它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10393.03, "timestamp": "02:53:13", "text": "但我不知道你为什么这么叫它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10395.03, "timestamp": "02:53:15", "text": "涅槃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10397.83, "timestamp": "02:53:17", "text": "对，那是一样的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10401.83, "timestamp": "02:53:21", "text": "不。嗯？但是，大麻并不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10404.67, "timestamp": "02:53:24", "text": "相同的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10407.51, "timestamp": "02:53:27", "text": "哦，好的。我现在彻底糊涂了。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10410.469, "timestamp": "02:53:30", "text": "你知道吗？香。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10413.429, "timestamp": "02:53:33", "text": "香。哦好的。好的。知道了。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10416.469, "timestamp": "02:53:36", "text": "好的。香都喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10420.07, "timestamp": "02:53:40", "text": "像敬拜神明那样虔诚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10423.269, "timestamp": "02:53:43", "text": "还有一种情况就像燃烧的木棍一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10427.03, "timestamp": "02:53:47", "text": "只是为了驱蚊。所以，你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10429.19, "timestamp": "02:53:49", "text": "我猜是土豆土豆吧。我不知道。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10433.91, "timestamp": "02:53:53", "text": "是的，我的观点依然成立。米拉娜是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10439.07, "timestamp": "02:53:59", "text": "不是蚊子牌子。是的。"}]